  "description": "Wild summer orange floral decor elements collection. Watercolor pre-made wedding invitation templates. Hand drawn flower border, leafs and flowers clip art comes with 31 different design elements. You can use them to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.\nAll vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.\nThe pack includes the following design elements as you can see in the preview:\n1 floral border\n30 watercolor set flower and leaf\nWith this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:\n31 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)\n31 JPG files\n31 SVG files\n1 Ai file (vector format)\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements\n1 PDF file\n1 DXF file\nNo logo and paper texture will appear on purchased items.\nFiles are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Wild summer orange floral decor elements collection. Watercolor pre-made wedding invitation templates. Hand drawn flower border, leafs and flowers clip art comes with 31 different design elements. You can use them to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.</p>\n<p>All vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.</p>\n<p>The pack includes the following design elements as you can see in the preview:</p>\n<p>1 floral border</p>\n<p>30 watercolor set flower and leaf</p>\n<p>With this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:</p>\n<p>31 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)</p>\n<p>31 JPG files</p>\n<p>31 SVG files</p>\n<p>1 Ai file (vector format)</p>\n<p>1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file</p>\n<p>1 Photoshop file with layered elements</p>\n<p>1 PDF file</p>\n<p>1 DXF file</p>\n<p>No logo and paper texture will appear on purchased items.</p>\n<p>Files are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.</p>",
